# Crystal run: ivorygate -> bd20_2457. Overrides data/scripts/idle_mine.smolt.
#
# TARGET: energy_crystal for the drone refit (3,607 short). forgotten_prism is 22
# of a 92-point mix = ~24% of yields, standing pool 5,000 — the best combination
# of share and depth in the survey. Yield is RANDOM from the site mix, so
# iron_ore and copper_ore come back too; that is expected, not a misfire.
#
# autopilot, NOT jump. `jump` is SINGLE-HOP: it fails outright with "X is not
# connected to Y" for anything not directly adjacent, and these agents start
# 5-16 jumps out. That is exactly how the first version of this script failed on
# 2026-08-26 — and because an idle script is best-effort, the failed jump did
# NOT abort the pass: the loop below then ran 100 `mine` attempts against
# "Nothing to mine here" while still docked at the origin, every pass. Autopilot
# routes multi-hop, tops the tank up at the ORIGIN station first, and takes the
# target POI as its second argument, which also removes the need for $NEBULA$.
#
# The nebula matters: the shared idle_mine travels to $ASTEROID_BELT$, and every
# high-share energy_crystal site is a NEBULA. On the default script these agents
# would mine the wrong rock.
#
# ivorygate has NO STATION, which is why its rock is untouched — the same reason
# frostfeld works for miner-10. Home is bd20_2457, 3 jumps out, whose fuel desk
# is MEASURED (2 cr/unit, ~54,800 reserve). An unverified desk in lawless space
# is how an agent strands, so do not shorten this to a nearer unmeasured station.
#
# refuel FIRST, while still docked from the prior cycle: it tops up before each
# trip AND recovers a bot that has run itself to empty. Several of these arrived
# from mission-learn at 0-4 fuel.
#
# get_system after the return leg is load-bearing: $STATION$ resolves against the
# client's cached POI list, which still holds the previous system right after a
# jump. get_system is an info query, no tick cost.
refuel
undock
autopilot ivorygate forgotten_prism
loop -f 100 mine
autopilot bd20_2457
get_system
travel $STATION$
dock
deposit_all
